msgstr "datoteka PDF"

#: src/postulo/templates/server/design.html
msgid "A person, a company or a plugin, as initials on a colour until there is a picture."
msgstr "Oseba, podjetje ali vtičnik, kot začetnice na barvi, dokler ni slike."

#: src/postulo/core/web_links.py
msgid "A personal site, a blog, a portfolio — as many as are worth showing, with one of them marked as the one to show. Documents print that one."
msgstr "Osebno spletno mesto, blog, portfelj — kolikor jih je vredno pokazati, pri čemer je eno označeno kot tisto, ki se prikaže. Na dokumentih se natisne to."

#: src/postulo/core/help.py
msgid "A photograph for your CVs, kept apart from your picture. It is kept as you frame it, and a CV prints it only when you tick that on the CV. The plain text and the Word file never carry it."
msgstr "Fotografija za vaše življenjepise, ločena od vaše slike. Shrani se tako, kot jo obrežete, življenjepis pa jo natisne le, če to označite na življenjepisu. Navadno besedilo in datoteka Word je nikoli ne vsebujeta."

#: src/postulo/templates/jobs/capture_page.html
#, python-format
msgid "A picture of the page that “%(title)s” was read from"
msgstr "Slika strani, iz katere je bil prebran »%(title)s«"

#: src/postulo/accounts/forms.py
msgid "A picture of the whole page. One sent by your browser extension shows the page as you were seeing it, signed in or not. Where there is none, one can be drawn here from the kept source, with scripts and the network off: the words of the page, without its looks."
msgstr "Slika cele strani. Slika, ki jo pošlje razširitev vašega brskalnika, prikazuje stran, kot ste jo videli, prijavljeni ali ne. Če je ni, jo je mogoče tu narisati iz shranjenega vira, z izklopljenimi skripti in omrežjem: besede strani brez njenega videza."

#: src/postulo/templates/jobs/capture_page.html
msgid "A picture taken in a browser shows the page as it was being seen there, signed in or not."
msgstr "Slika, posneta v brskalniku, prikazuje stran, kot so jo tam videli, prijavljeni ali ne."

#: src/postulo/templates/help/your_picture.html
#, python-format
msgid "A picture you upload has to be %(formats)s, of no more than %(megabytes)s MB and no more than %(megapixels)s megapixels. What the file is decides, not what it is called. Anything else is refused, with the reason, and the picture you had stays."
msgstr "Slika, ki jo naložite, mora biti %(formats)s, velika največ %(megabytes)s MB in največ %(megapixels)s megapikslov. Odloča, kaj datoteka je, ne kako se imenuje. Vse drugo je zavrnjeno, z razlogom, vaša dosedanja slika pa ostane."

#: src/postulo/templates/help/your_picture.html
msgid "A picture you uploaded is shown rather than your Gravatar, and your Gravatar rather than your initials. <em>Remove the uploaded picture</em> is offered once there is one: tick it and save, and the file is deleted."
msgstr "Naložena slika se prikaže namesto vašega Gravatarja, Gravatar pa namesto vaših začetnic. <em>Odstrani naloženo sliko</em> je na voljo, ko slika obstaja: označite jo in shranite, datoteka pa se izbriše."

#: src/postulo/templates/accounts/profile.html
#: src/postulo/templates/jobs/contact_form.html
msgid "A pin for it is drawn on your map, at its postcode or town, and only you can see it."
msgstr "Na vašem zemljevidu je zanj narisan žebljiček pri njegovi poštni številki ali kraju, vidite pa ga samo vi."

#: src/postulo/templates/partials/postal_addresses.html
msgid "A place rather than a whole address, and kept as it is. For post to reach it:"
msgstr "Kraj in ne celoten naslov, shranjen, kot je. Da bo pošta prispela:"

#: src/postulo/documents/integrity.py
msgid "a plain text file"
msgstr "navadna besedilna datoteka"

#: src/postulo/templates/widgets/suggestions.html
#, python-format
msgid "A plugin has suggested one thing that may have happened: <a href=\"%(suggestions_url)s\" class=\"font-medium underline\">look at it</a>."
msgid_plural "Plugins have suggested %(counter)s things that may have happened: <a href=\"%(suggestions_url)s\" class=\"font-medium underline\">look at them</a>."
msgstr[0] "Vtičnik je predlagal %(counter)s stvar, ki se je morda zgodila: <a href=\"%(suggestions_url)s\" class=\"font-medium underline\">poglejte jo</a>."
msgstr[1] "Vtičniki so predlagali %(counter)s stvari, ki sta se morda zgodili: <a href=\"%(suggestions_url)s\" class=\"font-medium underline\">poglejte ju</a>."
msgstr[2] "Vtičniki so predlagali %(counter)s stvari, ki so se morda zgodile: <a href=\"%(suggestions_url)s\" class=\"font-medium underline\">poglejte jih</a>."
msgstr[3] "Vtičniki so predlagali %(counter)s stvari, ki so se morda zgodile: <a href=\"%(suggestions_url)s\" class=\"font-medium underline\">poglejte jih</a>."

#: src/postulo/templates/applications/suggestion_list.html
msgid "A plugin that reads a mailbox or a calendar for you files what it finds here, and it stays here until you accept or decline it."
msgstr "Vtičnik, ki namesto vas bere poštni predal ali koledar, sem odloži, kar najde, to pa ostane tu, dokler tega ne sprejmete ali zavrnete."

#: src/postulo/templates/server/plugins.html
msgid "A plugin's own file is checked against the checksum its catalogue signed. Its requirements are not: those are fetched from PyPI when it is installed, and are whatever is served that day. Trusting a plugin means trusting its list of requirements too. Postulo installs only built wheels, never a source package that would run its own code while installing, and records everything that arrived."
msgstr "Datoteka samega vtičnika se preveri glede na kontrolno vsoto, ki jo je podpisal njegov katalog. Njegove odvisnosti pa ne: te se ob namestitvi prenesejo s PyPI in so takšne, kot so na voljo tisti dan. Zaupati vtičniku pomeni zaupati tudi njegovemu seznamu odvisnosti. Postulo namešča le zgrajene pakete wheel, nikoli izvornega paketa, ki bi med nameščanjem izvajal lastno kodo, in zabeleži vse, kar je prispelo."

#: src/postulo/documents/integrity.py
msgid "a PNG picture"
msgstr "slika PNG"

#: src/postulo/core/design.py
msgid "A popover or a menu, over the page rather than in it."
msgstr "Pojavno okno ali meni, nad stranjo in ne v njej."

#: src/postulo/resume/registry.py
msgid "A portfolio, a profile, a video: work of yours that already lives somewhere."
msgstr "Portfelj, profil, video: vaše delo, ki je že nekje."

#: src/postulo/notifications/base.py
msgid "A posting arrives through the capture API"
msgstr "Oglas prispe prek API-ja za zajem"

#: src/postulo/templates/jobs/listing_form.html
msgid "A posting you have noticed. The company and the title are enough to start; the rest can come later."
msgstr "Oglas, ki ste ga opazili. Podjetje in naziv zadostujeta za začetek; ostalo lahko dodate pozneje."

#: src/postulo/resume/forms.py
msgid "A prize, a scholarship, a “best paper”: recognition, with nothing to check and no expiry. A credential that may lapse is a certification, and a degree’s classification, such as “cum laude”, is that education entry’s grade."
msgstr "Nagrada, štipendija, »najboljši članek«: priznanje, pri katerem ni česa preverjati in ki ne poteče. Dosežek, ki lahko poteče, je certifikat, klasifikacija diplome, kot je »cum laude«, pa je ocena tistega vnosa o izobrazbi."

#: src/postulo/resume/candidate.py
#, python-format
msgid "A profile holds at most %(most)s nationalities, and this lists more."
msgstr "Profil ima lahko največ toliko državljanstev: %(most)s, ta seznam pa jih navaja več."

#: src/postulo/core/web_links.py
msgid "A profile on a forge, or one project worth showing — as many as are worth listing, with one of them marked as the one to show. Documents print that one."
msgstr "Profil na razvojni platformi ali en projekt, ki ga je vredno pokazati — kolikor jih je vredno navesti, pri čemer je eden označen kot tisti, ki se prikaže. Na dokumentih se natisne ta."

#: src/postulo/core/web_links.py
msgid "A profile on GitHub, Forgejo, GitLab or similar."
msgstr "Profil na GitHubu, Forgeju, GitLabu ali podobni platformi."

#: src/postulo/resume/forms.py
msgid "A programme, the slides or a recording. A CV does not print it."
msgstr "Program, prosojnice ali posnetek. Življenjepis tega ne natisne."

#: src/postulo/resume/forms.py
msgid "A public page for the course or its certificate."
msgstr "Javna stran za tečaj ali njegov certifikat."

#: src/postulo/templates/server/plugins.html
msgid "A Python wheel (<code>.whl</code>) built for any platform. Postulo reads what it says about itself and shows you that before anything is installed."
msgstr "Paket wheel za Python (<code>.whl</code>), zgrajen za katero koli platformo. Postulo prebere, kaj paket navaja o sebi, in vam to pokaže, preden se kar koli namesti."

#: src/postulo/templates/applications/report.html
msgid "A quarter"
msgstr "Četrtletje"

#: src/postulo/templates/server/design.html
msgid "A question over the page, answered before anything is done. This one asks about nothing, and neither answer changes anything."
msgstr "Vprašanje nad stranjo, na katero odgovorite, preden se karkoli naredi. To ne sprašuje o ničemer in noben odgovor ničesar ne spremeni."

#: src/postulo/templates/server/logs.html
msgid "A quiet log is the one you want."
msgstr "Tih dnevnik je tisti, ki si ga želite."

#: src/postulo/resume/forms.py
msgid "A range such as 41–52, or one page."
msgstr "Razpon, na primer 41–52, ali ena stran."

#: src/postulo/documents/forms.py
msgid "A referee who is not a contact yet. Their name is enough; it is added to your contacts without a company, and is used instead of the choice above."
msgstr "Referenčna oseba, ki še ni med vašimi stiki. Dovolj je ime; oseba se doda med vaše stike brez podjetja in se uporabi namesto zgornje izbire."

#: src/postulo/applications/ical_import.py
msgid "A reminder"
msgstr "Opomnik"

#: src/postulo/notifications/base.py
msgid "A reminder falls due"
msgstr "Opomnik zapade"

#: src/postulo/applications/forms.py
msgid "A reminder falls due a day ahead, when there is a day ahead."
msgstr "Opomnik zapade dan prej, kadar dan prej obstaja."

#: src/postulo/accounts/models.py
msgid "A reminder of who this is for."
msgstr "Opomba, komu je namenjeno."

#: src/postulo/core/server_forms.py
msgid "A rendering heavier than this is refused before it is read. Left empty, the instance's own setting applies."
msgstr "Upodobitev, težja od te, je zavrnjena, še preden se prebere. Če pustite prazno, velja nastavitev instance."

#: src/postulo/jobs/pages.py
msgid "A rendering is a PNG, JPEG or WebP image, or a PDF, and the request did not say which."
msgstr "Upodobitev je slika PNG, JPEG ali WebP ali pa PDF, zahteva pa ni povedala, katera."

#: src/postulo/jobs/pages.py
#, python-format
msgid "A rendering is a PNG, JPEG or WebP image, or a PDF. That was %(kind)s."
msgstr "Upodobitev je slika PNG, JPEG ali WebP ali pa PDF. To je bilo %(kind)s."

#: src/postulo/templates/jobs/capture_review.html
msgid "A rendering of the page this was read from was kept."
msgstr "Upodobitev strani, iz katere je bilo to prebrano, je bila shranjena."

#: src/postulo/templates/widgets/shortcuts.html
msgid "A report on a period"
msgstr "Poročilo o obdobju"

#: src/postulo/templates/server/backup_restore.html
msgid "A restore replaces everything on this instance with what is in the archive, so nothing else may be using the database while it runs. Stop the web service, the scheduler and the worker first, restore, and start them again. Run these on the machine that hosts the instance, not in this browser. The restore command is given <code>--force</code> because this instance already has accounts."
msgstr "Obnova nadomesti vse na tej instanci z vsebino arhiva, zato med njenim izvajanjem nič drugega ne sme uporabljati podatkovne zbirke. Najprej ustavite spletno storitev, razporejevalnik in delovni proces, izvedite obnovo in jih znova zaženite. Te ukaze poženite na računalniku, ki gosti instanco, ne v tem brskalniku. Ukaz za obnovo dobi <code>--force</code>, ker ima ta instanca že račune."

#: src/postulo/templates/server/design.html
msgid "A row"
msgstr "Vrstica"

#: src/postulo/templates/help/messaging.html
msgid "A row is one way of being reached on a messaging service: Matrix, XMPP, Signal, Telegram, Threema or another. Choose the service, give the handle, and name the service yourself under <em>Other</em>. As many as are worth keeping, with one marked as the one to use."
msgstr "Vrstica je en način, kako ste dosegljivi prek storitve za sporočanje: Matrix, XMPP, Signal, Telegram, Threema ali druge. Izberite storitev, vnesite uporabniško ime, pod <em>Drugo</em> pa storitev poimenujte sami. Kolikor jih je vredno obdržati, z eno označeno kot tisto za uporabo."

#: src/postulo/templates/core/import_csv.html
msgid "A row whose status is draft becomes a listing and any other status an application; a row with no status becomes an application if it has a date applied and a listing if it has none. Applications are dated as the spreadsheet says and marked as imported on their timeline."
msgstr "Vrstica, katere stanje je osnutek, postane oglas, vsako drugo stanje pa prijava; vrstica brez stanja postane prijava, če ima datum prijave, in oglas, če ga nima. Prijave so datirane, kot pravi preglednica, in na časovnici označene kot uvožene."

#: src/postulo/jobs/capture_views.py
msgid "A saved capture is part of its listing. It goes when the listing does."
msgstr "Shranjen zajem je del svojega oglasa. Izbriše se skupaj z oglasom."

#: src/postulo/templates/server/overview.html
msgid "A scheduled backup was due and nothing took it."
msgstr "Načrtovana varnostna kopija je bila na vrsti, a je ni nič izdelalo."

#: src/postulo/templates/server/backups.html
msgid "A scheduled backup was due and nothing took it. Is the scheduler running? A backup on a schedule needs it."
msgstr "Načrtovana varnostna kopija je bila na vrsti, a je ni nič izdelalo. Ali razporejevalnik teče? Varnostne kopije po urniku ga potrebujejo."

#: src/postulo/accounts/forms.py
msgid "A scheme left out is not drawn in a company's summary. It is never deleted: its values stay in the forms, in the export and on any CV you chose to print them on."
msgstr "Shema, ki je izpuščena, se ne prikaže v povzetku podjetja. Nikoli se ne izbriše: njene vrednosti ostanejo v obrazcih, v izvozu in v vseh življenjepisih, v katerih ste jih izbrali za tisk."

#: src/postulo/resume/forms.py
msgid "A school, a company, a platform: as a CV should print it. It is linked to the company of that name among yours, and added to your companies if there is none."
msgstr "Šola, podjetje, platforma: tako, kot naj bo natisnjeno v življenjepisu. Poveže se s podjetjem s tem imenom med vašimi in se doda med vaša podjetja, če takega ni."

#: src/postulo/core/models.py
msgid "A second signal beside the word, never instead of it."
msgstr "Drugi signal ob besedi, nikoli namesto nje."

#: src/postulo/templates/server/design.html
msgid "A section heading"
msgstr "Naslov razdelka"

#: src/postulo/templates/core/home.html
msgid "A self-hosted job application manager, written from the applicant's side of the table. Your applications, your CVs, your cover letters, on your server."
msgstr "Upravljalnik prijav na delovna mesta, ki ga gostite sami, napisan s strani kandidata. Vaše prijave, vaši življenjepisi, vaša spremna pisma, na vašem strežniku."

#: src/postulo/templates/server/groups.html
msgid "A set of accounts. A group can own companies, contacts and listings, which every member can then see, change, share and delete, and records can be shared with it; it is also what an access rule on a plugin or a module points at. Whoever leaves keeps a copy of what their own records need; a group that still owns records cannot lose its last member or be deleted."
msgstr "Skupina računov. Skupina ima lahko v lasti podjetja, stike in oglase, ki jih nato vsak član lahko vidi, spreminja, deli in briše, z njo pa je mogoče deliti zapise; nanjo kaže tudi pravilo dostopa za vtičnik ali modul. Kdor odide, obdrži kopijo tega, kar potrebujejo njegovi zapisi; skupina, ki ima še zapise v lasti, ne more izgubiti zadnjega člana ali biti izbrisana."

#: src/postulo/accounts/models.py
msgid "A short professional title, such as “Backend engineer”."
msgstr "Kratek poklicni naziv, na primer »Razvijalec zaledja«."

#: src/postulo/templates/server/person_recovery.html
#, python-format
msgid "A single-use link that lets %(name)s choose a new password, good for %(minutes)s minute. Postulo does not send it anywhere: you hand it over yourself, by whatever means you already trust."
msgid_plural "A single-use link that lets %(name)s choose a new password, good for %(minutes)s minutes. Postulo does not send it anywhere: you hand it over yourself, by whatever means you already trust."
msgstr[0] "Enkratna povezava, s katero si %(name)s izbere novo geslo, veljavna %(minutes)s minuto. Postulo je ne pošlje nikamor: izročite jo sami, na kakršen koli način, ki mu že zaupate."
msgstr[1] "Enkratna povezava, s katero si %(name)s izbere novo geslo, veljavna %(minutes)s minuti. Postulo je ne pošlje nikamor: izročite jo sami, na kakršen koli način, ki mu že zaupate."
msgstr[2] "Enkratna povezava, s katero si %(name)s izbere novo geslo, veljavna %(minutes)s minute. Postulo je ne pošlje nikamor: izročite jo sami, na kakršen koli način, ki mu že zaupate."
msgstr[3] "Enkratna povezava, s katero si %(name)s izbere novo geslo, veljavna %(minutes)s minut. Postulo je ne pošlje nikamor: izročite jo sami, na kakršen koli način, ki mu že zaupate."

#: src/postulo/templates/help/install.html
msgid "A site can only be installed when it is served over HTTPS. If no browser offers to install it, ask whoever runs this server."
msgstr "Spletno mesto je mogoče namestiti le, če je dostopno prek HTTPS. Če nobeden brskalnik ne ponudi namestitve, vprašajte upravljavca tega strežnika."

#: src/postulo/accounts/forms.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "A small key cap beside Save and next, Discard and next, Skip to the next and the search box. Turning it off hides the caps only; the keys keep working (see above), and a screen reader is still told about them."
msgstr "Majhna oznaka tipke ob gumbih Shrani in naprej, Zavrzi in naprej, Preskoči na naslednjega ter ob iskalnem polju. Izklop skrije le oznake; tipke še naprej delujejo (glejte zgoraj), bralnik zaslona pa jih še vedno sporoči."

#: src/postulo/templates/server/design.html
msgid "A small one"
msgstr "Majhen"

#: src/postulo/templates/help/links.html
msgid "A social profile is one to a service: a service another row already uses is greyed out in the menu and cannot be chosen again, and saving refuses a second one. A service that lives on many servers, such as Mastodon, and <em>Other</em> can be used as often as you like, and so can the cards of code repositories. Rows that already shared a service stay as they are, with a note, until you change them."
msgstr "Družbeni profil je lahko le eden na storitev: storitev, ki jo že uporablja druga vrstica, je v meniju zatemnjena in je ni mogoče znova izbrati, shranjevanje pa drugega zavrne. Storitev, ki deluje na več strežnikih, kot je Mastodon, in <em>Drugo</em> lahko uporabite poljubnokrat, prav tako kartice repozitorijev kode. Vrstice, ki so si že delile storitev, ostanejo nespremenjene z opombo, dokler jih ne spremenite."

#: src/postulo/templates/applications/application_form.html
msgid "A status changed here is recorded on the timeline, the same as anywhere else."
msgstr "Stanje, spremenjeno tukaj, se zapiše na časovnico, tako kot kjer koli drugje."

#: src/postulo/plugins/syncing.py
msgid "A sync of this connection is already running."
msgstr "Sinhronizacija te povezave že poteka."

#: src/postulo/templates/server/design.html
msgid "A table inside a card"
msgstr "Tabela znotraj kartice"

#: src/postulo/resume/forms.py
msgid "A talk, a workshop, a panel or a committee, or an event you took part in: one place on set days. Learning with a provider, a length and an outcome belongs in Courses, and a paper in Publications. Listing an event you only attended is your call."
msgstr "Predavanje, delavnica, okrogla miza ali odbor ali dogodek, pri katerem ste sodelovali: en kraj na določene dni. Izobraževanje pri ponudniku z dolžino in izidom spada med Tečaje, članek pa med Objave. Ali boste navedli dogodek, ki ste se ga le udeležili, je vaša odločitev."

#: src/postulo/core/channels.py
#, python-format
msgid "A telephone number has between %(low)d and %(high)d digits, and that one has %(count)d."
msgstr "Telefonska številka ima od %(low)d do %(high)d števk, ta pa jih ima %(count)d."

#: src/postulo/templates/help/messaging.html
msgid "A telephone number that is also on a messaging app belongs under <em>Telephone numbers</em>. The filled star marks the primary. The bin removes a row at once, after asking, without waiting for <em>Save</em>."
msgstr "Telefonska številka, ki je tudi v aplikaciji za sporočanje, sodi pod <em>Telefonske številke</em>. Polna zvezdica označuje glavno. Koš vrstico po potrditvi odstrani takoj, brez čakanja na <em>Shrani</em>."

#: src/postulo/templates/core/import_csv.html
msgid "A template with Postulo's own columns and one example row. Fill it in and upload it above."
msgstr "Predloga s stolpci Postula in eno vzorčno vrstico. Izpolnite jo in naložite zgoraj."

#: src/postulo/core/server_views.py
#, python-format
msgid "A test message from %(name)s"
msgstr "Preizkusno sporočilo od %(name)s"

#: src/postulo/templates/server/design.html
msgid "A text field"
msgstr "Besedilno polje"

#: src/postulo/applications/models.py src/postulo/jobs/models.py
msgid "A three-letter ISO 4217 code, such as EUR, GBP or USD."
msgstr "Tričrkovna koda ISO 4217, na primer EUR, GBP ali USD."

#: src/postulo/templates/server/design.html
msgid "A tile"
msgstr "Ploščica"

#: src/postulo/jobs/tiles.py
msgid "A tile server of your own"
msgstr "Lasten strežnik ploščic"

#: src/postulo/templates/api/token_list.html
msgid "A token lets a tool outside Postulo act for you — a browser extension handing over a posting, an agent reading your search — and does only what its scopes allow. It is not a sign-in: it never reaches the web interface, and two-factor authentication does not apply to it."
msgstr "Žeton omogoča orodju zunaj Postula, da deluje v vašem imenu — razširitvi brskalnika, ki preda oglas, agentu, ki bere vaše iskanje — in počne le to, kar dovoljujejo njegovi obsegi. Ni prijava: nikoli ne doseže spletnega vmesnika in dvostopenjsko preverjanje zanj ne velja."

#: src/postulo/templates/help/postal_addresses.html
msgid "A town and a country alone are kept as a place. Nothing checks that an address exists, and a country Postulo has no rules for is free-form."
msgstr "Samo kraj in država se shranita kot kraj. Nič ne preverja, ali naslov obstaja, za državo, za katero Postulo nima pravil, pa je oblika prosta."

#: src/postulo/resume/candidate.py
msgid "A translation"
msgstr "Prevod"

#: src/postulo/templates/server/people.html
msgid "A username is unique across the instance whoever changes it, and people can change their own under Settings."
msgstr "Uporabniško ime je edinstveno v celotni instanci, ne glede na to, kdo ga spremeni, in vsak lahko svoje spremeni v Nastavitvah."

#: src/postulo/templates/cotton/identifier_schemes.html
msgid "A value the scheme accepts. It is shown where the kinds are listed, and in the sentence that refuses a value of another shape."
msgstr "Vrednost, ki jo shema sprejme. Prikazana je tam, kjer so navedene vrste, in v stavku, ki zavrne vrednost drugačne oblike."

