msgid "The first choice in each list follows your details: mark another number as primary there and this CV prints it. One you choose here stays, whatever becomes primary. If you later delete it from your details, this CV prints none of that kind until you choose again, and never another in its place. What you have already sent does not change."
msgstr "Prva izbira na vsakem seznamu sledi vašim podatkom: tam označite drugo številko kot glavno in ta življenjepis natisne njo. Tista, ki jo izberete tu, ostane, ne glede na to, katera postane glavna. Če jo pozneje izbrišete iz svojih podatkov, ta življenjepis ne natisne nobene take vrste, dokler ne izberete znova, in nikoli druge namesto nje. Kar ste že poslali, se ne spremeni."

